    "title": "Say whether an outcome is achievable",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-potential-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Say whether an outcome is achievable",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put 得 or 不 between an action and a compatible result to express whether that result can be achieved. 听不懂 describes inability to understand by listening; 没听懂 reports a result not achieved on an occasion; 不听 simply negates listening and does not assert inability.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我听得懂。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ tīng de dǒng 。",
                "meaning": "I can understand what I hear.",
                "audio": "bd58a6d99f406351c4ce5ec8c9018946d4835fb2d0ddf94539bfc73582a09d8f"
              },
              {
                "text": "我听不懂。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ tīng bù dǒng 。",
                "meaning": "I cannot understand what I hear.",
                "audio": "f8c166de354f03698200050f63abc8a0bfb50400ecee9da00182507ff5c43d53"
              },
              {
                "text": "我没听懂。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ méi tīngdǒng 。",
                "meaning": "I did not understand what I heard on that occasion.",
                "audio": "fb59d1106b94cebc03bec4944c050f154107c7229c464b5f2d5ce307f5e79bf1"
              },
              {
                "text": "我不听。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ bù tīng 。",
                "meaning": "I will not listen.",
                "audio": "22d668ef5f4b7dc7d282c374849e01edc526c1e761f64de5bcf3fca5a3d1e6c9"
              }
            ]
